<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Khata: private, offline money tracker for Android</title>
<meta name="description" content="Khata is a private, offline money tracker for Android. No bank linking, no sign-up, no cloud. Heatmap, restock nudges, home-screen widgets and Indian languages.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Google+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#FBF3E4; --bg2:#F3E2C4; --ink:#2B1D14; --muted:#6E5847;
  --turmeric:#E3A21A; --chili:#B8432A; --jaggery:#8A5A2B;
  --glass:rgba(255,250,240,.55); --edge:rgba(255,255,255,.7); --shadow:rgba(120,70,20,.18);
  --sans:"Google Sans","Product Sans",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
  --hand:"Caveat","Segoe Script",cursive;
}
[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#17110D; --bg2:#241A13; --ink:#F6E9D6; --muted:#BBA48B;
  --glass:rgba(60,42,30,.45); --edge:rgba(255,226,180,.16); --shadow:rgba(0,0,0,.5);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.6;min-height:100vh;
  background-image:
   radial-gradient(520px 420px at 12% 8%,rgba(227,162,26,.38),transparent 70%),
   radial-gradient(480px 400px at 90% 30%,rgba(184,67,42,.26),transparent 70%),
   radial-gradient(600px 500px at 30% 95%,rgba(138,90,43,.28),transparent 70%);
  background-attachment:fixed;transition:background-color .3s,color .3s}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
.glass{background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(1.5);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(1.5);
  border:1px solid var(--edge);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 var(--edge),0 14px 40px var(--shadow);border-radius:26px}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--chili);outline-offset:3px}

/* nav */
nav{position:sticky;top:12px;z-index:10;margin:12px auto 0;max-width:1080px;padding:0 22px}
nav .glass{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 14px 10px 22px;border-radius:999px}
.logo{font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.01em}
.nav-r{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.nav-r a.l{padding:8px 12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
.nav-r a.l:hover{color:var(--ink)}
button.theme{font:inherit;font-size:.9rem;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;
  background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--edge)}
button.theme:hover{background:var(--glass)}

/* buttons */
.btn{display:inline-block;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;transition:transform .15s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn.main{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--turmeric),var(--chili));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(184,67,42,.35)}
.btn.alt{border:1px solid var(--edge);background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}

/* hero */
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:70px 0 50px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.4rem);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.hand{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--chili);display:block;margin-bottom:10px;transform:rotate(-2deg)}
[data-theme="dark"] .hand{color:var(--turmeric)}
.hero p.sub{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:30em;margin:20px 0 30px}
.cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.phone{justify-self:center;width:min(290px,78vw);padding:10px;border-radius:44px;transform:rotate(3deg)}
.phone img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:34px;background:var(--bg2)}

/* marquee */
.marquee{overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;padding:16px 0;border-block:1px solid var(--edge);
  background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);transform:rotate(-1deg);margin:26px -10px}
.track{display:inline-flex;animation:scroll 32s linear infinite}
.marquee:hover .track{animation-play-state:paused}
.track span{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;padding:0 26px;color:var(--jaggery)}
[data-theme="dark"] .track span{color:var(--turmeric)}
.track span::after{content:"/";margin-left:52px;color:var(--chili);opacity:.7}
@keyframes scroll{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* sections */
section{padding:60px 0}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-bottom:12px}
.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:36em;margin-bottom:34px}
.shots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}
.shot{padding:8px;border-radius:30px}
.shot:nth-child(even){margin-top:30px}
.shot img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:23px;background:var(--bg2)}
.shot figcaption{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:1.45rem;text-align:center;padding:8px 0 4px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.card{padding:26px}
.card h3{font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:6px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.98rem}
.card.wide{grid-column:span 2}
.note{margin-top:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-left:3px solid var(--turmeric);border-radius:6px;font-family:var(--hand);font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.3;background:rgba(227,162,26,.12)}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.two ul{margin:10px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}
.two li{margin:6px 0}
.final{text-align:center;padding:50px 24px;margin:20px 0 60px}
.final p{color:var(--muted);margin:6px auto 24px;max-width:30em}
footer{padding:30px 0 50px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
footer a{margin:0 10px}

@media(max-width:820px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:40px;text-align:left}
  .shots{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .grid,.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .card.wide{grid-column:auto}
  .nav-r a.l{display:none}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .track{animation:none}.marquee{overflow-x:auto}.btn:hover{transform:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav><div class="glass">
  <a class="logo" href="#top">Khata</a>
  <div class="nav-r">
    <a class="l" href="#shots">Screens</a>
    <a class="l" href="#features">Features</a>
    <a class="l" href="https://github.com/vijayarkananduri/khata">GitHub</a>
    <button class="theme" id="theme" aria-label="Switch between light and dark theme">Dark</button>
  </div>
</div></nav>

<main class="wrap" id="top">

<div class="hero">
  <div>
    <span class="hand">the old ledger, now in your pocket</span>
    <h1>Your money. Your phone. Nobody else.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Khata is a private, offline money tracker for Android. No bank linking, no sign-up, no cloud. You write the entries, the app keeps them, and nobody gets a copy.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn main" href="https://github.com/vijayarkananduri/khata/releases/latest">Download the APK</a>
      <a class="btn alt" href="https://github.com/vijayarkananduri/khata">View on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="phone glass"><img src="home.jpeg" alt="Khata home screen" width="540" height="1170"></div>
</div>

</main>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="track">
  <span>no bank linking</span><span>works fully offline</span><span>no account needed</span><span>your data stays on your phone</span><span>nudges before you run out</span><span>five Indian languages</span>
  <span>no bank linking</span><span>works fully offline</span><span>no account needed</span><span>your data stays on your phone</span><span>nudges before you run out</span><span>five Indian languages</span>
</div></div>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="shots">
  <h2>See where your money went</h2>
  <p class="lead">Four screens, nothing hidden. Home, calendar, widgets and settings.</p>
  <div class="shots">
    <figure class="shot glass"><img loading="lazy" src="home.jpeg" alt="Home screen" width="540" height="1170"><figcaption>home</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="shot glass"><img loading="lazy" src="calender.jpeg" alt="Calendar and heatmap" width="540" height="1170"><figcaption>calendar</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="shot glass"><img loading="lazy" src="widjet.jpeg" alt="Home-screen widgets" width="540" height="1170"><figcaption>widgets</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="shot glass"><img loading="lazy" src="settings.jpeg" alt="Settings" width="540" height="1170"><figcaption>settings</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="features">
  <h2>It tracks. That is the whole job.</h2>
  <p class="lead">Khata does a few things and does them quietly.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card glass wide">
      <h3>Nudges before you run out</h3>
      <p>Once Khata has seen you buy the same thing more than twice, it works out how often you buy it and reminds you when the next one is due. Milk, groceries, petrol, essentials. The maths happens on your phone, and you can switch nudges off in Settings.</p>
      <div class="note">A litre of milk lasts two days. On day two: "You may be running out of milk."</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card glass"><h3>Heatmap of your year</h3><p>A GitHub-style grid of your spending. Dark squares are the days your wallet had opinions.</p></div>
    <div class="card glass"><h3>Home-screen widgets</h3><p>Daily, weekly, monthly or all-time totals, and budget progress, without opening the app.</p></div>
    <div class="card glass"><h3>Your language</h3><p>Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, Malayalam and Kannada, in the original script or in English letters.</p></div>
    <div class="card glass"><h3>A bit of personality</h3><p>Short quotes inspired by movies and memes, because tracking money should not feel like a tax audit.</p></div>
    <div class="card glass"><h3>Matches your phone</h3><p>Light, Dark, System, or colours pulled from your wallpaper. Export everything as CSV any time.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="two">
    <div class="card glass"><h3>Khata is for you if</h3><ul>
      <li>You think your bank statement is none of an app's business</li>
      <li>You are happy to type in your own spending</li>
      <li>You want to see where money went, not be told how to invest it</li></ul></div>
    <div class="card glass"><h3>Khata is not for you if</h3><ul>
      <li>You want expenses to appear automatically from your bank</li>
      <li>You want AI forecasts, scores or smart insights</li></ul></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="final glass">
  <h2>Open the book.</h2>
  <p>Free to try. Install the APK, allow installs from your browser if Android asks, and start writing.</p>
  <a class="btn main" href="https://github.com/vijayarkananduri/khata/releases/latest">Download the latest APK</a>
</div>

</main>

<footer>
  <a href="https://github.com/vijayarkananduri/khata">Source code</a>
  <a href="https://github.com/vijayarkananduri/khata/releases">Releases</a>
  <a href="https://github.com/vijayarkananduri/khata/issues">Report a bug</a>
  <p style="margin-top:12px">Built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose and Room.</p>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var root=document.documentElement,btn=document.getElementById('theme'),saved=null;
  try{saved=localStorage.getItem('khata-theme')}catch(e){}
  var theme=saved||(window.matchMedia&&matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light');
  function apply(t){root.setAttribute('data-theme',t);btn.textContent=t==='dark'?'Light':'Dark'}
  apply(theme);
  btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
    theme=theme==='dark'?'light':'dark';apply(theme);
    try{localStorage.setItem('khata-theme',theme)}catch(e){}
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
